        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "bd417379-3a2d-5ec4-b55e-7a5bf1ce4725",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: David Vincent, Troy Sanders, Anthony Rezhawk, Katina Culture, Brent Hinds, Brann Dailor\n- Bands/Projects: Morbid Angel, Genitorturers, Mastodon, Terrorizer, Hordes of Zombies, Darker Days Ahead\n\nFacts:\n- David Vincent was born on April 22, 1965, and he is also known as Evil D.\n- David Vincent is an American musician best known as the former lead vocalist and bassist for Morbid Angel and as the bassist for Genitorturers.\n- Troy Sanders was born on September 8, 1973.\n- Troy Sanders is an American musician, singer, and songwriter best known as a member of the Atlanta, Georgia metal band Mastodon.\n- In Mastodon, Troy Sanders plays bass and shares lead vocal duties with guitarist Brent Hinds and drummer Brann Dailor.\n- Hordes of Zombies was Terrorizer's first album since 2006's Darker Days Ahead.\n- Hordes of Zombies was the only Terrorizer album to feature vocalist Anthony Rezhawk and guitarist Katina Culture.\n- Hordes of Zombies was the last Terrorizer album to feature bassist David Vincent.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
